  "body": "The web-platform-test [serial/getPorts/reject_opaque_origin.html](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/master/serial/getPorts/reject_opaque_origin.https.html) (and similar for requestPort()) seem to indicate that this call should not be allowed with an opaque origin. However, I don't see a reference to this in the spec under the \"Permissions policy\" or \"Security considerations\" sections. Does something need to be added to the spec, or is this implied in a way that I'm not seeing?\n\nThanks!",
